                                    <h3>OD & CC Loan</h3>
                                    <p>Overdraft (OD) and Cash Credit (CC) Loans are flexible financing solutions designed to meet the short-term working capital needs of businesses. These loans provide a revolving credit facility, allowing businesses to withdraw funds as needed, up to a pre-approved limit. OD and CC loans help manage cash flow, cover operational expenses, and address unexpected financial requirements without disrupting business operations.</p>

                                    <p><span>Overdraft (OD) Loan:</span> A credit facility linked to your bank account, allowing you to withdraw more than your account balance within a set limit. Interest is charged only on the utilized amount.</p>
                                    <p><span>Cash Credit (CC) Loan:</span> A short-term loan granted against inventory, receivables, or other business assets, providing working capital for daily operations.</p>
                                    <p>These financing options ensure that businesses have continuous access to funds, helping them maintain liquidity and operational efficiency.</p>
